            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_N202DB">
               <extent xml:id="extent_N202DC">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N202DF">35 x 24.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202E2">Written in brown ink. Paper: 18 staves. Above the music on p. 1 "Indledning" (Introduction). At the bottom of the page "(ogsaa Efterspil)" (also postlude). Above the music on p. 2 "'Danmark, mit Fædreland!' (Udkast)". Written on three staves. On the upper stave Hartmann has written "Instr: i Octaver med Syngestemmerne" (Instruments in octave with the voices). Page 4 blank.</physMedium>
